commit ec04eb95713b8c2a71bd851a83bf20370f909a95
ndt: say the heartbeat drop check in one line and keep its full answer

live-p1's driver keeps the first 6000 characters of ndt up's output per
arm, and the detect-only line the evidence tool reads comes later in
it. The check's answer is now one line on ndt up, with the limit, and
the whole answer is written to .test_run/logs/heartbeat_drop_check.log.


