commit 03bb18800899b5df6be19cb88955aa45e9646984
external detect-only: report no destination paths on an external control plane

On an external control plane running its own pipeline the forwarding
belongs to the exercise's controller and nothing installed is known to
the proxy. The declared links still seed the graph for the heartbeat,
but the paths endpoint no longer renders shortest paths over them, and
a link transition no longer pushes them. ndt's verify and status texts
say none is expected there.


