live-p1 evidence gate: a mutation for every check, and a report of the ones never red

The gate now keeps each mutant's full suite run and fails if any check
of the suite was never turned red by a mutation. Eleven mutations cover
the checks that none did before, including the rc-0 controls and two
checks held by several guards at once. The treatment-is-a-control cell
now runs that case and checks the refusal by its message.


