commit a8d11f02c127cc863a71aac10368d5ddacae5fa6
live-p1 external evidence: require H5 samples across each arm, two controls, settled counters

compare now refuses without H5's samples and a second control. Each
treatment arm's session must be sampled running and fresh from its
start until after the exercise's controller last wrote, with no other
session in the arm window; the daemon's sampled counters decide what the
loaded program forwarded. Controls with any trace of the heartbeat are
refused, invariants count only when every control keeps them, and a
last counter block that had not settled is unreadable.


