commit 45ca199ef25ea4f7a94e61615bdbfa49411ddb1e
external detect-only: source-level wording, status text, H4 and sampler checks

The census now says the three external programs were read from their P4
source, not measured with the programs loaded; H5 will be the first
measurement. ndt status no longer calls a package fabric's destination
path count 'none expected'. H4 judges the restore through a strict-bound
verdict and gains cells for an unaccepted restore and a moved table
generation. The H5 sampler records each report's written_wall,
stop_reason and all four daemon counters, and H5 saves 06's end time.


